WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.080
<i>That</i> is the "transform" ability...

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.760
She's not some sort of weapon.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.760
She's just a girl who grew up
in a slightly different world.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:18.430
I heard that the girl isn't actually
complete as a weapon yet.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.630
Which means that sooner is better
if you want to attack her.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.770
So, what're you gonna do?

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.440
So, what're you going to do now?

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.110
It's easy!

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.780
I'll make a lot of noise
so that they'll notice.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.120
Then, Torneo'll probably use Eve...

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.120
So, that's when you'll attack her!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.090
That's when I'll rescue her.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:47.130
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:54.300
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:13.420
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:19.760
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:26.100
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:32.440
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:45.450
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.460
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:58.450
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:20.090
She's still incomplete
in a number of areas.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.090
We need to intensify
her training a bit.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:28.430
In addition, we must not
damage the product!

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:32.770
Tighten security so that
she can never escape again!

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:33.770
Yes, sir!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:39.040
Really, a hit product
always comes with troubles...

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.780
I am...

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.120
...a weapon.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.650
"Smiling Cat"

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.160
Okay...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.220
I see. Those're some
airtight defenses...

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.740
What'd you find out?

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.400
It looks like the guards
are all inside of the premises.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.410
I saw more than 10
while scanning the premises.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.080
They've spread out
infrared rays above the fences.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.750
As expected, it doesn't look like
it'll be easy to get in...

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.420
Then, I guess we'll force open
the front gate and make some noise.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.420
What? How are we
gonna open it!?

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.940
Well, just watch.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:31.910
What're you doing?

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.930
Hey, it's not exploding.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.770
You think I'd just
suddenly throw a bomb?

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.780
Okay, so?

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.940
Wha-?

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.730
H- Hey!
What the hell!?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.220
Looks like it worked...
the "here kitty kitty" bomb.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.070
Huh?

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:15.400
It seems there's
some noise out front...

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.410
Wh-what's with all these cats!?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.740
Where did they come from?!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.070
--Shoo, shoo!
--Go away!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.410
Okay, let's make some noise!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:31.180
This is ridiculous!
Oh, whatever!!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.760
Him again!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:41.430
Hey! Thanks to your "kitty kitty"
whatever, now Black Cat is here too!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:42.760
Don't be stupid!

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.890
Intruders!
Shoot! Shoot!

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:55.780
<i>If I don't find Eve</i>
<i>before he does...</i>

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:57.610
<i>he'll definitely kill her!</i>

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.380
<i>Black Cat'll definitely</i>
<i>kill her this time!</i>

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.050
Hey! Hey! I'll leave
Black Cat to you!

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.390
I'll go find the
nanotechnology data!

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:07.720
Got it.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.060
Be careful!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.220
You too!!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:15.060
What's going on?

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.230
Torneo-<i>sama</i>!
We have intruders!

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:18.390
Intruders!?

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:26.670
Black Cat... S- so, this is what
one of Chronos' erasers can do!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:33.580
Calm down, Flit. It's just
a stray cat who wandered in!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.580
Torneo-<i>sama...</i>

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.420
Something's going on
in the basement...

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:41.420
The basement lab!
Check it right away!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.250
Yes, sir!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.330
It's so quiet
it's giving me the creeps.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.710
<i>Man, I'm pathetic!</i>

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.550
<i>He's fighting</i>
<i>all those enemies</i>

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:12.040
<i>while breaking</i>
<i>all those security cameras!</i>

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:17.060
<i>On top of that,</i>
<i>he's also looking for Eve's room.</i>

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.390
<i>Even still, I'm falling behind</i>
<i>rather than catching up with him!</i>

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.730
<i>If I don't do something,</i>
<i>Eve will...</i>

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.890
<i>Eve will...</i>

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.070
<i>Eve will be...</i>

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.410
<i>...killed by him!</i>

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.170
<i>I can't help it.</i>
<i>I guess I'll use the right eye...</i>

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.070
Vision Eye!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.420
I wonder what this suspicious
security lock is for...

00:06:56.100 --> 00:07:01.200
Tada! I spent a lot of money
on this special card key,

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.900
so it'd better open it...

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.040
There we go!

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:19.390
Eve, your prey's here.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.720
Prey?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.890
That's right,
it's your prey.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:28.730
He's an assassin called Black Cat, who snuck
into my vacation home the other day.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.060
He's after you.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:33.400
But you're it.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.730
It...

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:38.070
That's right.
You're it!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.410
I'm... it.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.250
You're it...

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.480
It!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.750
It...

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:04.360
Understand? You're it,
so you hunt the prey!

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.030
<i>Damn Eve!</i>

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:10.530
<i>She's just a bio-weapon, but she's</i>
<i>started developing a sense of self!?</i>

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:15.710
Torneo-<i>sama</i>!
He'll be here any moment!

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:20.700
Got that, Eve!? You're it!
You kill the prey!

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:27.050
This is...

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.890
Who did this?

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:38.400
"Tips on how to make rolled omelets
without turning it into toxic waste"?

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.570
What the heck is this?

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.400
Tearju Lunatique...

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.890
If I remember correctly,
she's an authority on nanotechnology...

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:01.190
H- he's approaching Eve's room
at unbelievable speed!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.680
It's only a matter of time...

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.370
Flit, have the "NS amplifying
oscillator" ready!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.030
But, that's still not ready yet...

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.540
Yes, sir!
Understood!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.890
All right, I'm ready for you!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.690
I'll show you what my work on
nanotechnology weapons has produced!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.080
He's here!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.620
What is this place!?
It's just like a monster museum!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.460
Let's see...

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:46.130
"Nanotechnology composition
through the ingestion of G-cells".

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:49.300
And, this one says,
"Fusion of cytoskeleton genes

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:52.800
ingested with OD weapons
and nanotechnology"?

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:56.760
Looks like they've been doing all sorts
of God-knows-what experiments...

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.560
Well...

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.440
Now, shall we go?

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:36.430
I promised you... that we'll
go out for good food, remember?

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:47.450
It's a piece of candy.
It's sweet, isn't it?

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.790
Do you like it?

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:57.800
O- okay, then! Let's go eat
something that tastes better!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.960
Let me see,
hamburger steak...

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.770
You know, we'd better
get out of here soon, otherwise...

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.070
Are you all right!?
Are you all right!?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.250
Don't scare me like that!

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:23.920
You have to keep the candy in your mouth
until it becomes smaller, okay?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.590
Wh- what is it?
H- hey! Hey!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.770
My handkerchief...

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.070
Ice cream...

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:43.780
She ate it, and...

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.780
...used this... handkerchief...

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.440
...to wipe her...

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.790
Oh, no! I don't want you
to use that handkerchief!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.780
He's here!

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:05.390
Go, Eve!
It's time to play tag!

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:07.720
Don't, Eve!

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.570
I smell blood...

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:17.400
I smell blood...

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.750
I smell blood...

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:28.480
I'm it... I'm it...
I'm it...

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.430
...the ultimate bio-weapon...

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.100
S- so, this is...

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:40.100
Now, Eve! Take down
Black Cat immediately!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.440
You're it!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.100
I'm it...

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.770
Don't listen to him, Eve!
You're not it!

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:52.110
What're you doing!?
Kill Black Cat already!!

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:55.780
Shut up, Torneo!
I won't let her kill anyone!

00:13:55.780 --> 00:14:00.720
Ha! Looks like a rat
wandered in along with the cat...

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:04.390
I'm not a rat!
I'm a sweeper!

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.060
Sweeper...

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:10.230
C'mon, Eve!
Let's go eat good food!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.720
Good food...

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:25.080
I can't allow that. I'm sorry,
but I have to kill her...

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:30.080
Hmph... So you just do
whatever your owner tells you?

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.090
You saw it, right?
She's dangerous.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:36.590
You kill dangerous people,
even if they're children, huh?

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:41.760
Man, Chronos is really...
disgusting!!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:42.560
Let's go!

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:51.830
Eve, what're you doing?
Kill Black Cat now!!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:58.930
Don't tell me you're
running away with that rat?

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.540
I see...

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.060
Eve!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.390
--Flit!
--Yes, sir!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.390
What're you doing!? Do it!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.880
B- but...

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.730
Torneo! What're you doing to Eve!?

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:34.910
That card causes the nanomachines
in Eve's body to go out of control.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.080
What!?

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.090
Eve! Kill Black Cat!

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.020
Don't, Eve!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.260
Don't let him get away, Eve!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.710
Flit, take away his briefcase...

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:02.710
Y- yes, sir!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.140
Since you don't
need it any more...

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:11.720
What a brave sweeper you are,
risking your life to come and see Eve...

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.220
What do you want with Eve?

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.720
What are <i>you</i> planning
to do with Eve!?

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.890
Oh? That's a silly question...

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:23.900
Eve is a product of my research
and my property.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:28.070
What happens to Eve
is no one's business but mine.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:32.740
Eve isn't a human.
She's a "weapon".

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.570
Are you saying that Eve
will become a monster!?

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:42.200
What're you saying?
She always has been a monster.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:48.590
Now, enough chatter.
I think it's about time for you to die...

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.360
What are you doing?

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:13.380
Where... am I?

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.710
What the heck's going on here!?

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:16.700
What!?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.390
Now, Rins!!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:21.790
What is this!?

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.400
What the heck is going on!?

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.730
No time to explain!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.560
Eve will... Eve will
become a monster!!

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:42.230
Th- this is... Eve!?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.610
Stop it, Eve!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:59.430
It's no use. No matter what you say
to Eve now, she won't hear it.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:04.530
No one can stop her
until she kills Black Cat...

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.700
No one can...

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:13.040
Ha! Even in times like this,
a gentleman... doesn't give up!!

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:14.100
What!?

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.380
Wait! What're you gonna do!?

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:33.730
<i>Hold on, Eve!</i>

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:34.720
<i>Soon...</i>

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:43.230
I'll soon bring you back
to your old self!!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.720
So, it was a failure...

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.210
Torneo-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:39.390
The basement lab is-!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:40.650
The lab?

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.230
My life... turned to ashes...

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.610
It's dangerous,
Torneo-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.420
Did you do that?

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:12.760
No way... When I arrived at the lab,
it was already destroyed...

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:16.100
Destroyed?
Black Cat?

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.430
Maybe...

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:22.100
But, you were planning
to destroy it, too, right?

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:25.440
It wasn't for money
this time, right?

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:31.110
I didn't really mean
to hide it from you, but...

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:35.110
The place where that military facility
holding nanotechnology collapsed...

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:39.450
Some time before that incident,
I lived in that area for a little while.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:44.460
It was a peaceful town
with pretty flowers...

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.460
I see...

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:47.950
More importantly,
what're you gonna do with her?

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.130
What!?
Black Cat!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:54.790
Y- you!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:06.410
I don't shoot if I don't wanna shoot...
Yes, that's the right answer!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.750
He...

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.430
Train Heartnet...

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:22.090
Although the event he staged
was a bit flashy,

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:25.100
apparently he's succeeded.

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:27.430
It looks like it took
a little longer than usual, too...

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:32.100
When pursuing a mission, it has to be
carried out efficiently and faithfully...

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.770
Time and effort
should not be wasted.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:36.780
Things worked out
all right in the end.

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:40.440
Everything went well.
That's good enough, isn't it?

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.450
Good evening!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.130
What?

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:55.460
Did something good happen?

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.130
Not really...

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.800
I see...

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.390
Oh yeah, I haven't asked you
your name, have I?

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:16.910
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:20.920
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:26.690
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:41.600
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:47.380
<i>Around the time the first evening star</i>
<i>appears, I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:53.280
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:56.290
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.520
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:02.890
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:08.570
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:14.570
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:17.570
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:20.910
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.250
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:33.590
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.930 --> 00:23:43.900
"Next Episode"
Everything I see and hear
is new to me.

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:46.770
Everything I see and hear
is new to me.

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:51.110
But, there seem to be a lot of difficulties
in the outside world, too.

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.410
The man who came
to kill me before

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:56.450
said he was going to leave
the organization.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:58.980
I wonder if it has something
to do with the fact

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:02.390
that he didn't
shoot me that time...

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:02.950
Ah! Ramen!

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:05.890
"Cat Makes a Decision"
Ah! Ramen!
